7. RESEARCH AND EDUCATIONAL PURPOSE

The ESP32-Based Digital Stethoscope Research Prototype is an experimental project intended for educational, engineering, and research purposes.

The project has not been established as a clinically validated medical device. Unless separately validated and appropriately authorized, it must not be relied upon for medical diagnosis, treatment decisions, clinical patient monitoring, or the prevention of medical conditions.

All testing and evaluation must be conducted responsibly, with appropriate safety precautions and compliance with applicable ethical, institutional, and legal requirements.

